# Copy to .env and fill in. MVP only: keys ship client-side for personal
# testing. A backend proxy replaces these before any public launch.
#
# Anthropic — powers the live character conversations.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# ElevenLabs — powers spoken character replies (voice). Optional: without
# it, the app runs text-only and hides the mute toggle. Bills by usage, so
# guard this key even more carefully than the Anthropic one.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
